      <activity id="d1299cf7-848b-5d6a-8e93-f52534c71b44" activityNameId="04c0a284-deb7-57eb-8679-03a8ef73162b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler fan burner non-modulating &lt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler fan burner non-modulating &lt;100kW
NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements under controlled conditions;
UUID: d574f9f0-9d67-3f04-b24e-4f0076bd93f7
The module includes fuel input from low pressure (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Natural gas input (low pressure) and emission data extrapolated from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: Models on market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturers; CO and NOx emissions from (SVGW 2002), sample size (number of selected devices for which emission values are given in SVGW list): CO 72 , NOx 73 . 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d574f9f0-9d67-3f04-b24e-4f0076bd93f7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
